          "已经有报道说，剑桥接到公立学校学生的电话，他们说自己现在不打算费力去申请了。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "there are reports already",
            "char": 96,
            "actual_first_word": "there",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              1077.95,
              1078.03
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 9,
        "en": "Now one of the ways they want to do it is to give the schools the opportunity to run themselves more completely than they are doing at the moment, to give schools more powers, exactly the same as you.",
        "at": "to give schools more",
        "zh": [
          "他们想采取的一种做法，是让学校比现在更全面地自主管理，",
          "赋予学校更多权力，这和您的主张完全一样。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "to give schools more",
            "char": 147,
            "actual_first_word": "to",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              1114.95,
              1115.03
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 13,
        "en": "The present government talks about freedom for schools, it talks about getting money into schools, but if you look in the detail of what they are proposing, the reality is very different.",
        "at": "but if you look",
