          "但只要仔细看看他们提出的方案，就会发现实际情况完全不同。"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "but if you look",
            "char": 99,
            "actual_first_word": "but",
            "actual_first_word_window": [
              1138.64,
              1138.72
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "sentence": 26,
        "en": "So, at the moment, a certain amount of money goes to schools, a certain amount of money goes to local education authorities, are you saying that in future, no money will go to Local Education Authorities, but all of the money will go to the schools.",
        "at": "are you saying that",
        "zh": [
          "所以，目前有一部分钱拨给学校，另一部分拨给地方教育主管部门。",
          "您的意思是，将来将不再有经费拨给地方教育主管部门，而是全部拨给学校？"
        ],
        "true_cut_word_anchors": [
          {
            "at": "are you saying that",
